  "body": "The `Location` object probably requires special treatment since setting its setters do not actually change the underlying URL directly. They just cause navigation. And the last navigation seems to win, too:\n\n``` js\nlocation.pathname = \"x\"\nlocation.protocol = \"https\"\n```\n\nNavigates to a URL with a new scheme, not a new path.\n",
